abstract: >-
  TurtleML is a nested systems-architecture concept for composing independently
  operable units into larger systems-of-systems through explicit boundaries,
  interfaces, recursive containment, and implementation-independent contracts.
keywords:
  - systems architecture
  - systems of systems
  - recursive composition
  - modular architecture
  - provenance
